:{"status":[{"label":"生效时机","value":"普通攻击造成伤害时"}],"groups":[],"nested":[],"linked":[{"id":"heroJob4BuffAddBuff","name":"猎人标记","note":"","known":true}]}}],"archives":[{"title":"欢迎来到我们的营地！","desc":"沃夫加：你好，小工匠，入住营地后，我一直想要和你打招呼，今天终于找到机会了。\n沃夫加：你选的这个地方不错，避风且隐蔽，是个适合休憩的好营地。\n沃夫加：习惯了在深山里风餐露宿，原本以为我已经不再需要所谓的“归宿”，但在进入营地的那一刻，我发现自己似乎并不排斥这种感觉。\n沃夫加：拿着吧，这是我在狩猎途中找到的好东西，现在送给你。\n沃夫加：只要你在这里，我便随时听候你的召唤。猎人的承诺如同射出的箭矢一样，一旦出口必定遵守，请你相信我。","taskDesc":"","unlockFav":0,"type":4,"reward":{"id":"new_hero_first","items":[{"id":"money","name":"银币","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00001.webp","quality":5,"count":1000,"chance":1},{"id":"ke","name":"氪金","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00002.webp","quality":5,"count":50,"chance":1}]},"mail":null,"taskTypeId":"","taskName":"","dialogs":[],"stats":{}},{"title":"契约信息","desc":"姓名：沃夫加\n所属：荒野客\n出身：巴诺姆村，索利德山\n技能：狩猎，精确射击\n住址：居无定所，有事请联系驿站\n武器：自制的惯用猎弓\n兴趣：拆骨，制皮，冥想\n契约附语：我喜欢独来独往，但有事随时可来找我。","taskDesc":"","unlockFav":0,"type":0,"reward":null,"mail":null,"taskTypeId":"","taskName":"","dialogs":[],"stats":{}},{"title":"伙伴简介","desc":"　　沃夫加是一名流浪猎人，似乎成为驿站的契约者有很长一段时间了。\n　　从外表上看，沃夫加显然是一名成熟的猎手。破旧的弓箭与匕首，藏匿在毛发与皮肤之间的伤痕，彰显着一股生人勿近的味道。但沃夫加对待每一位合作的契约者都保持应有的礼貌，据说这是身为猎人的“礼仪”。","taskDesc":"","unlockFav":0,"type":0,"reward":null,"mail":null,"taskTypeId":"","taskName":"","dialogs":[],"stats":{}},{"title":"猎场住民","desc":"　　沃夫加在求生者草原拥有自己的猎场，除去同驿站合作的时间，他一年四季几乎都徘徊在猎场之中。他也因此经常被人调侃成“被困在猎场的套中狼”。","taskDesc":"","unlockFav":5,"type":3,"reward":null,"mail":null,"taskTypeId":"","taskName":"","dialogs":[],"stats":{"phyAtk":200,"magicAtk":200}},{"title":"隐蔽处的孤狼","desc":"　　沃夫加发来信件，似乎说想见识见识你的狩猎技巧。","taskDesc":"　　无论是打猎还是出行，沃夫加总是一人行动。哪怕在驿站吃饭的时候，他也会独自一人在角落进食。这种独来独往的行事风格使他总被称为“孤狼”。","unlockFav":10,"type":1,"reward":{"id":"heroArchives01","items":[{"id":"money","name":"银币","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00001.webp","quality":5,"count":1000,"chance":1},{"id":"ke","name":"氪金","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00002.webp","quality":5,"count":100,"chance":1}]},"mail":{"id":"mail_fav_hero_012_1","mailType":2,"title":"我对你有所耳闻……","content":"[myName]：\n　　你可能在求生者草原见过我。\n　　其实，在和你签订契约前，我就对你的事有所耳闻。听人说，你不仅是位娴熟的工匠，更是一位高超的猎人。这么说来，咱们也算是同行了。还真想见识见识你的狩猎技巧呢。\n　　虽说……我向来不太习惯和人组队，但既然签订了契约，我的力量就供你所用，随意差遣便是。以后，就请多多指教了。\n\n沃夫加","hasAttachment":false,"reward":{"id":"heroArchives01","items":[{"id":"money","typeId":"item_00001","name":"银币","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00001.webp","quality":5,"count":1000,"chance":1},{"id":"ke","typeId":"item_00002","name":"氪金","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00002.webp","quality":5,"count":100,"chance":1}]},"taskTypeId":"fav_hero_012_1","getTaskText":"接受","image":""},"taskTypeId":"fav_hero_012_1","taskName":"第一次的共同狩猎","dialogs":[{"id":"fav_hero_012_1_0","name":"沃夫加-营地对话【沃夫加，有空吗？】"},{"id":"fav_hero_012_1_1","name":"沃夫加-第一次的共同狩猎-进入战役"}],"stats":{}},{"title":"暗中学习","desc":"　　虽然沃夫加看起来不在乎别人，但若遇见优秀的人，他也会在暗中观察学习。他曾在驿站铁匠铺枯坐一下午，只为观察学习对面铁匠的打铁技艺。","taskDesc":"","unlockFav":15,"type":3,"reward":null,"mail":null,"taskTypeId":"","taskName":"","dialogs":[],"stats":{"maxHp":500}},{"title":"来自山村的猎人","desc":"　　沃夫加发来信件，想要找你和他一起去新猎场狩猎。","taskDesc":"　　很少有人知道，沃夫加的故乡正是远在山边的巴诺姆村。沃夫加本人很少提起这事，似乎是对故乡有很不好的回忆。有些村民们提起沃夫加时，会将他称为“叛徒”。","unlockFav":20,"type":1,"reward":{"id":"heroArchives02","items":[{"id":"money","name":"银币","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00001.webp","quality":5,"count":2000,"chance":1},{"id":"ke","name":"氪金","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00002.webp","quality":5,"count":100,"chance":1},{"id":"item_20023","name":"特别招待券","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_20023.webp","quality":5,"chance":1}]},"mail":{"id":"mail_fav_hero_012_2","mailType":2,"title":"发现新的猎场","content":"[myName]：\n　　上次你我共同狩猎让我学到了不少，这次还想邀你同行，不知你是否愿意？我在西南边发现了一处不错的天然猎场，不少猎人都爱去那里。那里有着很多魔物巢穴，猎物充足，我们绝不会空手而归。\n　　我现在动身去你的营地。\n\n沃夫加","hasAttachment":false,"reward":{"id":"heroArchives02","items":[{"id":"money","typeId":"item_00001","name":"银币","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00001.webp","quality":5,"count":2000,"chance":1},{"id":"ke","typeId":"item_00002","name":"氪金","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00002.webp","quality":5,"count":100,"chance":1},{"id":"item_20023","typeId":"item_20023","name":"特别招待券","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_20023.webp","quality":5,"count":1,"chance":1}]},"taskTypeId":"fav_hero_012_2","getTaskText":"赴约","image":""},"taskTypeId":"fav_hero_012_2","taskName":"重遇故乡人","dialogs":[{"id":"fav_hero_012_2_0","name":"沃夫加-营地对话【猎场在哪？我们出发吧。】"},{"id":"fav_hero_012_2_1","name":"沃夫加-重遇故乡人-进入战役"}],"stats":{}},{"title":"孤独的狼","desc":"　　虽然沃夫加看起来目中无人，但他其实也很在乎别人的看法，常常因为听到别人一句话而纠结不已。他曾因为在驿站听到有人批评自己射不准，就一个人偷偷在靶场加练了好几晚。","taskDesc":"","unlockFav":25,"type":3,"reward":null,"mail":null,"taskTypeId":"","taskName":"","dialogs":[],"stats":{"crit":5}},{"title":"猎人的情绪","desc":"　　沃夫加发来信件，表示找到一个新猎场，邀请你一起去打猎。","taskDesc":"　　作为一个专业的猎人，沃夫加的行为很少被情绪所影响。不过他一旦陷入情绪化之中，状态便会大打折扣，甚至连思考能力都会变差。而这时的沃夫加总会躲起来，独自在营地帐篷里吃面包。","unlockFav":30,"type":1,"reward":{"id":"heroArchives03","items":[{"id":"money","name":"银币","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00001.webp","quality":5,"count":3000,"chance":1},{"id":"ke","name":"氪金","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00002.webp","quality":5,"count":200,"chance":1},{"id":"item_20023","name":"特别招待券","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_20023.webp","quality":5,"chance":1}]},"mail":{"id":"mail_fav_hero_012_3","mailType":2,"title":"这次不会再遇到其他人了","content":"[myName]：\n　　你好，这次我又寻得一处天然猎场，想邀你一同前去打猎，希望你能同意。\n　　这个猎场比较偏僻，应该不会遇到其他人，也不会发生和上次一样的意外，我们可以更安心地专心打猎。\n\n沃夫加","hasAttachment":false,"reward":{"id":"heroArchives03","items":[{"id":"money","typeId":"item_00001","name":"银币","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00001.webp","quality":5,"count":3000,"chance":1},{"id":"ke","typeId":"item_00002","name":"氪金","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00002.webp","quality":5,"count":200,"chance":1},{"id":"item_20023","typeId":"item_20023","name":"特别招待券","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_20023.webp","quality":5,"count":1,"chance":1}]},"taskTypeId":"fav_hero_012_3","getTaskText":"赴约","image":""},"taskTypeId":"fav_hero_012_3","taskName":"磨损的武器","dialogs":[{"id":"fav_hero_012_3_0","name":"沃夫加-营地对话【沃夫加又来了呀。】"},{"id":"fav_hero_012_3_1","name":"沃夫加-磨损的武器-进入战役"}],"stats":{}},{"title":"独行者的羞涩","desc":"　　每当收到夸赞，沃夫加总会面不改色地保持谦虚，但他其实非常享受他人的称赞。哪怕称赞已过了好几天，沃夫加回忆起来时也总会露出微笑，并奖励自己好好喝一杯。","taskDesc":"","unlockFav":35,"type":3,"reward":null,"mail":null,"taskTypeId":"","taskName":"","dialogs":[],"stats":{"critDam":20}},{"title":"珍视的猎具","desc":"　　沃夫加发来信件，想要请你帮忙打造一把全新的弓。","taskDesc":"　　武器是猎人的第二副骨，沃夫加十分珍视自己的弓箭，他会在狩猎结束的夜晚悉心保养。但再坚韧的武器也会有破损的那日。在得到新的弓后，他本人也开启了新的旅程。","unlockFav":40,"type":1,"reward":{"id":"heroArchives04","items":[{"id":"money","name":"银币","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00001.webp","quality":5,"count":4000,"chance":1},{"id":"ke","name":"氪金","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00002.webp","quality":5,"count":200,"chance":1},{"id":"item_20023","name":"特别招待券","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_20023.webp","quality":5,"chance":1}]},"mail":{"id":"mail_fav_hero_012_4","mailType":2,"title":"来看看你的营地","content":"[myName]：\n　　在屋里休整了一段时间，也抽空好好保养了身上的装备，现在状态好了不少。新弓要用的木材我也备齐了，这就动身来找你，一起把新武器做出来。\n　　说起来，和你一同行动了这么多回，还没仔细参观过你那在荒野建的营地，这次能好好看看里面是什么样的。\n\n沃夫加","hasAttachment":false,"reward":{"id":"heroArchives04","items":[{"id":"money","typeId":"item_00001","name":"银币","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00001.webp","quality":5,"count":4000,"chance":1},{"id":"ke","typeId":"item_00002","name":"氪金","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00002.webp","quality":5,"count":200,"chance":1},{"id":"item_20023","typeId":"item_20023","name":"特别招待券","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_20023.webp","quality":5,"count":2,"chance":1}]},"taskTypeId":"fav_hero_012_4","getTaskText":"赴约","image":""},"taskTypeId":"fav_hero_012_4","taskName":"荒野独狼的过往","dialogs":[{"id":"fav_hero_012_4_0","name":"沃夫加-营地对话【欢迎来到我的营地！】"},{"id":"fav_hero_012_4_1","name":"沃夫加-荒野独狼的过往-进入战役"}],"stats":{}},{"title":"猎人守则","desc":"　　关于狩猎，沃夫加有着自己的一套准则，比如：禁止狩猎幼崽以保证猎物种群延续，禁止虐待魔物等等……对于他来说，猎人不能仅在乎手上的武器，还要关注自己的内心和遥远的未来。","taskDesc":"","unlockFav":45,"type":3,"reward":null,"mail":null,"taskTypeId":"","taskName":"","dialogs":[],"stats":{"phyDef":500,"magicDef":500}},{"title":"信念的箭矢","desc":"　　沃夫加发来信件，表示自己已恢复状态，想要邀请你一同去捕猎一头发疯的角猪。","taskDesc":"　　即便经历了许多挫折，沃夫加仍然会坚持拯救他人的理想。他的箭并不止会对准魔物，也会对准危害弱者安全的罪恶之人。","unlockFav":50,"type":1,"reward":{"id":"heroArchives05","items":[{"id":"money","name":"银币","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00001.webp","quality":5,"count":5000,"chance":1},{"id":"ke","name":"氪金","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00002.webp","quality":5,"count":200,"chance":1},{"id":"item_20023","name":"特别招待券","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_20023.webp","quality":5,"chance":1},{"id":"item_20004","name":"契约书","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_20004.webp","quality":5,"chance":1}]},"mail":{"id":"mail_fav_hero_012_5","mailType":2,"title":"感觉自己好多了","content":"[myName]：\n　　多亏上次你的开导，，让我重新振作起来了。接下来我将会返回猎场，用你为我打造的武器开始新的狩猎征程。\n　　这次狩猎我还是想要邀请你共同行动，不过这次狩猎目标只有一个角猪。我收到消息，那头角猪频繁袭击过往的旅人，很多据点也遭到它的攻击。为了避免伤害扩大，我们一起解决掉那个麻烦吧。\n\n沃夫加","hasAttachment":false,"reward":{"id":"heroArchives05","items":[{"id":"money","typeId":"item_00001","name":"银币","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00001.webp","quality":5,"count":5000,"chance":1},{"id":"ke","typeId":"item_00002","name":"氪金","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_00002.webp","quality":5,"count":200,"chance":1},{"id":"item_20023","typeId":"item_20023","name":"特别招待券","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_20023.webp","quality":5,"count":2,"chance":1},{"id":"item_20004","typeId":"item_20004","name":"契约书","img":"/images/Common_ItemIcon/item_20004.webp","quality":5,"count":1,"chance":1}]},"taskTypeId":"fav_hero_012_5","getTaskText":"赴约","image":""},"taskTypeId":"fav_hero_012_5","taskName":"坚守信念的新征程","dialogs":[{"id":"fav_hero_012_5_0","name":"沃夫加-营地对话【已经恢复状态了吗？】"},{"id":"fav_hero_012_5_1","name":"沃夫加-坚守信念的新征程-进入战役"}],"stats":{}}],"behavior":{"chat":[{"dialog":"yd_012_01","min":0,"max":14},{"dialog":"yd_012_02","min":0,"max":14},{"dialog":"yd_012_03","min":0,"max":14},{"dialog":"yd_012_04","min":15,"max":29},{"dialog":"yd_012_05","min":15,"m